00 and clipped M2-3 intervals, malformed/empty/overflow/gapped parts, resolver failure, MIDI/workspace/history nonmutation, Save/Reopen/JSON/Backup timeline reconstruction, and legacy overflowing Section load/render write 0\n- #279 baseline reproduced incorrect Section totals: 1 selected bar -> A/B/C 2/3/2 bars; 2 -> 2/3/3; 4 -> 4/5/4\n- new total: 19 regression tests; no test disabled or guard weakened\n\n## Checkpoints and protected refs\nIndependent branch `feature/music-ai-section-exact-preview-v1`, based on fresh #279 `c6a73c24706e31a95120201f1b552dbca43f6312`. Checkpoints `9da640f` and `4faed5d` saved through non-force ref updates. Fresh final audit confirms main `552d56eafddfd192970c09f7d6278696cf8775c3` and all 24 pre-existing Draft HEADs unchanged. No existing PR or branch was modified. This PR remains Open / Draft / mergeable.\n\nSource audit and verification record: `verification/music-ai-section-exact-preview-audit.json`, `verification/music-ai-section-exact-preview.md`.\n\n## Remaining acceptance\nPhysical Intel Mac/Chrome and M1 iPad/Safari: separate synthetic project, generate Family B for four bars, view Section rows, select Section M2-3, Plan -> Preflight -> Confirm -> Undo -> Redo -> Save -> Reopen; confirm MIDI unchanged. Check physical iPad touch/Japanese font rendering. Normal MIDI partial Apply playback and Keystation Mini 32 MK3 recording/playback remain physical checks. Previous Intel Mac Audio-to-MIDI accuracy remains pending separately; Linux Chrome does not establish these results.\n\nProject Section writing, Arrangement instrument rendering and Lyrics realization remain future work; Continuation dependency/conflict policy remains unchanged. No unrequested policy is inferred.\n\nSynthetic deterministic local only. No real songs/backups, migration/load-time writes, feature removal, Live Provider/External AI/API key communication, Ready/Merge/Auto Merge or force push.",
