      "draft": true,
      "body": "The Editor's internal change transaction bypassed #267 range protection when direct note, recording, candidate or repair APIs were called. Validate original/destination tick protection before every commit when the actual lock dependency is present; restore the entire rejected session, return explicit errors, and expose a non-persistent failure counter to prevent ignored nested rejections. Explicit note flags remain separate from range releases. Raw malformed locks and saved additive state without enforcing dependencies fail closed.\n\nIndependent main-based Draft for the next commit-boundary stage. This does NOT enable browser A numbering/ruler/snap/resize or change host loaders; internal scalar timing remains documented, so do not activate through asset loading alone. Depends on #265 (7d2f0f49cdbc56e57fab6cef9a64681cc6168c8c) and #267 (f06cf5ac29d2fa96857ce0dc623d6e1696f016a6). Overlaps protected #262 only in Editor source; exact three-way synthetic integration applied without conflict and retains #262 APIs/versions. No protected PR changes.\n\nValidation: 33 focused PASS (original main reproduced 25 FAIL / 8 PASS). Seven actual meter scenarios preserve scalar legacy lock ticks and exact additive releases. Full node --test with immutable dependencies: 807 / 801 PASS / 6 FAIL; fresh main 774 / 768 PASS / identical six FAIL, zero new failures. All 96 JS node --check and git diff --check PASS. Local-only #262–#267 synthetic integration: 907/907 PASS, 105 JS syntax PASS, including #267's fake IndexedDB, actual save/JSON import and memory Backup/Restore tests. Final-head CI completed SUCCESS: dedicated Editor commit lock guard [run 36966130519](https://github.com/puitoybox-cloud/nova-studio/actions/runs/36966130519), including focused 33/33, full/baseline identity comparison, synthetic 907/907 and all syntax/whitespace checks; existing scoped MIDI repair [run 36966130488](https://github.com/puitoybox-cloud/nova-studio/actions/runs/36966130488) also SUCCESS. This commit-boundary stage is verified; coordinated production browser integration remains unfinished.\n\nFiles: music-studio-editor.js; tests/music-studio-editor-commit-locks.test.js; tools/verify-node-baseline.js; verification/music-editor-commit-locks.md; dedicated workflow. No storage migration, real saved songs/backups, UI file changes, external Provider/AI calls, main/protected PR mutation or remote integration branch. UI 1440/820/390 and Console checks not performed. Remaining coordinated browser and physical Mac/iPad work are documented. Draft only: no Ready/Merge/Auto Merge/force push.",
